G98tSWAxV3m68BHaPzM0oQ3IcHCNsBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["拖到現在才上心得！\u003e\u003c\n久違又能來台北吃到鬼金棒～真的是太爽了。\n上次在西門店吃真的難忘到不行！雖然在高雄火山吃很多次了，但能在台北吃到本家才是王道。\n過去都吃一般辣麻味噌，不過聽很多麵友說 沾麵更好吃。\n於是這次剛好本店有賣沾麵 真的是運氣不錯，點了沾麵雖然可惜沒有角煮，而是牛肉 不過重點還是在於麵跟醬汁的配合才是重點。\n\n說是沾麵現做比較久，不過居然不到3分鐘就端到面前 真的好快!!!\n這還是我吃拉麵這麼多年以來 第一次這麼快出餐~~\n立刻夾起麵體沾了醬汁吃了一口，不誇張 直接嘴裡開party\n那個粗麵 不用沾醬就好多汁，加上是冷麵 口感很特別～麵體又非常Q彈~而且份量又多!!!沾著吃每一口都是讓人難以忘懷的口味!!!\n\n過去也吃過不同家的沾麵，真的沒有比鬼金棒的沾麵 還來的令人有這麼爽的用餐體驗～下次如果有機會在北上去吃 得再加麵才行啊!!!\n還有辣麻得再往上升一個檔次，這樣才夠味!!!\n真的真的好好吃~~",null,[0,75]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6781132535250818714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEdKWGJIUlJNR2gyV2tSc01sTnJSa3BUVjFKMFZtcE9hbEp0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,8743,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTGJXbHRRMGh2WkRsMlNrRkpTV1J0VmpOalJtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xb3054e4e4b79bcdf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnFLbWltQ0hvZDl2SkFJSWRtVjNjRmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dz